      "body": {
        "en": "To present someone, say who it is, where they are from and live, what they are like and what they do: *to jest Adam, on jest z Polski, mieszka w Krakowie, jest wysoki. Adam to biznesmen.* To ask someone's age, say *ile on ma lat?* or, to a friend, *ile masz lat?* After 2, 3 and 4 it is *lata*: *ma dwa lata*; after 5 to 20 it is *lat*: *ma dwadzieścia lat*."
      }
    }
